class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">River Shop</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Fuse Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Fuse Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Blast Radius\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blast Radius</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Blast Pressure\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blast Pressure</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">300</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1 Credit</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.51.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i>\"Wait, if it's a sticky bomb how doesn't it get stuck to your hand?\"</i></p></blockquote>\n<p>The <b>Sticky Bomb</b> is a special explosive sold exclusively at the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Shop</a> for 1 Credit. It is a throwable bomb that sticks to surfaces.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Sticky Bomb, unlike any other explosive, can be picked up and treated like a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Tools\" title=\"Category:Tools\">tool</a> that the player can hold in their inventory. While equipped, the user can throw it, which will cause it to stick to the first surface it impacts. On the ground, it can still be ignited as if it were any other explosive.\n</p><p>Regardless of the method of activation, the Sticky Bomb explodes like a regular <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Bomb\" title=\"Small Bomb\">Small Bomb</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 300px\"> \t<video src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c5/Sticky_Launching.mp4/revision/latest?cb=20240303085449\" width=\"300\" height=\"253\" class=\"thumbimage\" style=\"max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%; width: 300px; height: 253px;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:Sticky_Launching.mp4\">https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/File:Sticky_Launching.mp4</a></video> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Sticky_Launching.mp4\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Sticky launching technique</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>A gimmick of the Sticky Bomb is \"sticky jumping\" using vehicles. It has grown popular enough that the developers started a contest incentivizing people to \"trickshot\" with their sticky jumps. The winner of the contest will earn 6,000 Robux.</li>\n<li>A patch on 4 March, 2024 fixed an issue where \"property flinging\" could occur.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902120856\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 87/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 93/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019473/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.532      1 -total\n 94.62%   27.943      1 Template:Explosive\n  5.07%    1.498      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2315-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902120856 and revision id 10181. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Explosives"],"links":[{"title":"Category:Tools","exists":true},{"title":"River Shop","exists":true},{"title":"Small Bomb","exists":true}],"images":["Sticky_Bomb.png","Sticky_Launching.mp4"]}
